<body style="height: auto; min-height: auto;">
<p style="line-height:1.656; margin-top:16px; margin-bottom:16px"><span style="font-size:11pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap"><span style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif"><span style="color:#000000"><span style="font-weight:400"><span style="font-style:normal"><span style="text-decoration:none">Hi {{{Recipient.FirstName}}},</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>

<p style="line-height:1.656; margin-top:16px; margin-bottom:16px"><span style="font-size:11pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap"><span style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif"><span style="color:#000000"><span style="font-weight:400"><span style="font-style:normal"><span style="text-decoration:none">I’m reaching out because you previously connected with our team, and I wanted to see if now might be a good time to revisit that conversation.</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>

<p style="line-height:1.656; margin-top:16px; margin-bottom:16px"><span style="font-size:11pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap"><span style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif"><span style="color:#000000"><span style="font-weight:400"><span style="font-style:normal"><span style="text-decoration:none">Many agents are currently adjusting their plans for the start of the second quarter and looking for ways to build momentum. If you’re considering updated lead options or focusing on growth, I’d be happy to reconnect you with the right person on our team and walk through what may be available in your area.</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>

<p style="line-height:1.656; margin-top:16px; margin-bottom:16px"><span style="font-size:11pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap"><span style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif"><span style="color:#000000"><span style="font-weight:400"><span style="font-style:normal"><span style="text-decoration:none">I’ll plan to give you a call later this afternoon as well, but if there’s a better time to connect, feel free to reply here and let me know.</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>

<p style="line-height:1.656; margin-top:16px; margin-bottom:16px"><span style="font-size:11pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap"><span style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif"><span style="color:#000000"><span style="font-weight:400"><span style="font-style:normal"><span style="text-decoration:none">Thank you,</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>
<span style="font-size:11pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap"><span style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif"><span style="color:#000000"><span style="font-weight:400"><span style="font-style:normal"><span style="text-decoration:none">{{{Sender.FirstName}}}</span></span></span></span></span></span><br />
<span style="font-size:11pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap"><span style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif"><span style="color:#000000"><span style="font-weight:700"><span style="font-style:normal"><span style="text-decoration:none">{{{Sender.Phone}}}</span></span></span></span></span></span><br />
<strong><a href="{{{Sender.Salesforce_Meeting_Link__c}}}">Book Time Here</a></strong></body>
